1
00:00:00,624 --> 00:00:03,794
- I'm sure she'll still love him.
- I wouldn't.

2
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:07,009
Well, what do you wanna do?

3
00:00:07,172 --> 00:00:09,592
- I want to leave.
- Okay.

4
00:00:09,758 --> 00:00:11,968
- What's the protocol for leaving?
- I don't know.

5
00:00:12,136 --> 00:00:15,266
(Leonard:)I've never reneged
on a proffer of sperm before.

6
00:00:16,223 --> 00:00:17,643
(Sheldon:)Let's try just walking out.

7
00:00:18,517 --> 00:00:19,727
(Leonard:)Okay.

8
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,860
(Leonard:)- Bye.
- Bye-bye.

9
00:00:31,029 --> 00:00:32,449
Nice meeting you.

10
00:00:34,992 --> 00:00:38,412
- Are you still mad about the sperm bank?
- No.

11
00:00:39,246 --> 00:00:42,376
You wanna hear an interesting thing
about stairs?

12
00:00:42,541 --> 00:00:43,921
(Leonard:)Not really.

13
00:00:44,084 --> 00:00:47,084
If the height of a step is off
by as little as two millimeters...

14
00:00:47,254 --> 00:00:50,424
(Sheldon:)- ...most people will trip.
- I don't care.

15
00:00:51,258 --> 00:00:53,088
Two millime...? That doesn't seem right.

16
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:55,800
(Sheldon:)It's true.
I did a series of experiments when I was 12.

17
00:00:55,971 --> 00:00:58,021
(Sheldon:)My father broke his clavicle.

